 describe(s){return this.read(s)+'. '+foilBouts[s.bout].name+'. Thrust and parry cost two stamina; recovery restores two. Your thrust reaches distance 1–2. Enemy attacks interrupt unprotected strikes; a riposte has initiative. Opponent pattern: '+foilBouts[s.bout].intents.join(' → ')+'. Parry feints wastes two extra stamina. Three opponents, four touches each; 120 total actions.'},
